msgid ""
"Invoice %(number)s was not sent to LHDN within 72 hours of its issue time, "
"and LHDN no longer accepts it. Your draft is kept. Please review it and "
"approve it again."
msgstr ""
"发票 %(number)s 在开具后 72 小时内未能提交给 LHDN，LHDN 已不再接受。您的草稿已保留，"
"请检查后重新批准。"

#: .\core\einvoicing.py
msgid ""
"I understand that this company is a mandatory e-invoicing taxpayer. "
"Switching e-invoicing off means its invoices will not be sent to LHDN "
"MyInvois, and I am responsible for the consequences under the Income Tax "
"Act and the e-invoice guidelines."
msgstr ""
"我了解本公司属于强制实施电子发票的纳税人。关闭电子发票意味着其发票将不会提交至 "
"LHDN MyInvois，我须承担《所得税法》及电子发票指南下的相关后果。"

