#: .\core\templates\einvoice_setting.html
msgid ""
"This switch applies to new invoices only. Switching e-invoicing off does not "
"stop credit, debit and refund notes on invoices that were already sent to "
"LHDN, and switching it on does not move earlier normal invoices to "
"e-invoicing."
msgstr ""
"此开关仅适用于新发票。关闭电子发票不会影响对已提交至 LHDN 的发票开具贷项、借项和退款票据；"
"开启电子发票也不会把之前的普通发票改为电子发票。"
